# Jira Configuration Template

**Copy this file to `jira-config.env` and add your values**

```bash
# DO NOT commit jira-config.env to git!
# Add to .gitignore

# Your Atlassian Cloud ID
# Find at: https://developer.atlassian.com/cloud/confluence/oauth-2-3lo-apps/
JIRA_CLOUD_ID=your-cloud-id-here

# Your Jira site
JIRA_SITE=https://your-site.atlassian.net

# Your Jira project key
JIRA_PROJECT_KEY=SCRUM
```

**Before using prompts:**
1. Replace `{{JIRA_CLOUD_ID}}` with your actual Cloud ID
2. Replace `{{JIRA_SITE}}` with your site URL
3. Replace `{{JIRA_PROJECT_KEY}}` with your project key
